flowchart TD
  T[User question] --> N[Speech / domain normalisation]
  N --> R{What authority does the request need?}

  R -->|current farm fact / calculation / device state / action / graph| F[FarmPi deterministic authority]
  F --> D[(Validated MariaDB data + application rules)]
  D --> FR[Exact result or honest unavailable state]

  R -->|general explanation / external guidance| E[External-information authority]
  E --> E1[Reviewed DairyNZ / NZ government / other curated material]
  E --> E2[Trusted primary / reputable general source]
  E --> E3[Model knowledge when stronger evidence is unavailable]

  FR --> P[Provenance + source category + uncertainty]
  E1 --> P
  E2 --> P
  E3 --> P

  P --> C{Request satisfied?}
  C -->|yes| U[Useful response + evidence / chart]
  C -->|no| A[Inspect related application capabilities]
  A -->|nearby supported result| U
  A -->|genuinely ambiguous| Q[Ask concise clarification]
  A -->|no supported alternative| Z[Concise limitation + available options]

  E1 -. cannot override a conflicting current FarmPi observation .-> FR
  E2 -. cannot create a farm reading .-> FR
  E3 -. cannot create a farm reading .-> FR
